    use each of the following effects of "Akasuna the Battle Ashtra" once per turn.
    During the Main Phase (Quick Effect): You can send 1 Trap from your hand or face-down
    field to the GY; change all face-up monsters your opponent controls to face-down
    Defense Position. During your End Phase: You can Set 1 "Ashtra" Trap from your
    Deck.'
